+<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which home builder in Myrtle Beach is best?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We rank builders by homes sold, not by quality. D.R. Horton sold the most new homes in Horry County in the 12 months we counted (1,397). You can compare where each builds, what its homes cost, and the warranty and lender it states. We read any builder's contract with you before you sign."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is D.R. Horton or Lennar bigger in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"D.R. Horton. It sold 1,397 new homes in Horry County in those 12 months, against 967 for Lennar. Lennar's homes sold for less in the middle, about $258,000 against about $325,000."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why can't I find Ryan Homes in the listings?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Few of its homes are listed in the MLS, the database brokers share. Ryan Homes sold 477 homes here in those 12 months and had 1 listed on the day we counted. We ask the builder for its homes for sale directly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is Clayton Properties Group?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Berkshire Hathaway company that owns Mungo Homes. It is the seller on the deeds for Mungo's homes in Horry County."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a home builder need a license in South Carolina?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, for a job over $5,000. It can be a residential builder license or a general contractor license. Building without one is a misdemeanor."}}]}</script>
